{
  "bodyHash": "VI7iA6GS+Oo=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">礦物機率（Mineral Chance）是一個讓挖礦變得更加刺激的模組。它為挖掘石頭類方塊增加了一個隨機獲得礦物的機率。在主世界，這些石頭方塊包括<strong><em>石頭、安山岩、閃長岩、花崗岩、凝灰岩和深板岩</em></strong>。在地獄，則是<em><strong>地獄石、玄武岩和黑石</strong></em>。<br><br>預設情況下，有 1/50 的機率獲得礦物。主世界的礦物包括<em><strong>鑽石、鐵粒、金粒、青金石、紅石和綠寶石</strong></em>。地獄的礦物包括<em><strong>石英、金粒和獄髓碎片（1.16+）</strong></em>。使用絲綢之觸挖掘將不會掉落礦物。<br><br>所有礦物的掉落機率相同。發現礦物時的訊息可以在設定中修改或關閉。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective 模組\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 組合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"執行環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>extraMineralChanceOnOverworldStoneBreak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.02，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">挖掘主世界石頭方塊時掉落礦物的機率。預設為 1/50。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>extraMineralChanceOnNetherStoneBreak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.01，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">挖掘地獄石頭方塊時掉落礦物的機率。預設為 1/100。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableOverworldMinerals</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在主世界挖掘主世界石頭方塊有機率掉落主世界礦物。這些礦物包括鑽石、金粒、鐵粒、青金石、紅石和綠寶石。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherMinerals</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在地獄挖掘地獄石頭方塊有機率掉落地獄礦物。這些礦物包括石英、金粒和獄髓碎片（1.16+）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>disableMineralDropsWithSilkTouch</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，使用絲綢之觸附魔挖掘石頭將不會掉落礦物。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnMineralFind</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，當玩家發現礦物時，會發送一則訊息給該玩家。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>foundMineralMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"你在方塊中發現了隱藏的礦物！\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當 'sendMessageOnMineralFind' 啟用時，發送給發現隱藏礦物的玩家的訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignoreFakePlayers</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，如果玩家是模擬玩家，則不會掉落礦物。例如當某個模組以模擬玩家身份破壞方塊時。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/mineral-chance/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"606\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>在主世界中，將 '<em>extraMineralChanceOnOverworldStoneBreak</em>' 設為 0.5 時的效果：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/mineral-chance/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"534\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>在地獄中，將 '<em>extraMineralChanceOnNetherStoneBreak</em>' 設為 0.5 時的效果：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/mineral-chance/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"534\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多不同的模組頁面中追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
